        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Adhering to the philosophy of designing reliable, compact, and efficient pilotless aerial vehicles that meet the evolving needs of urban transportation, we have a rich set of innovative products with differentiated advantages for diversified and immense market demands.",
        "start_character": 25283,
        "end_character": 25552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a first mover, we not only design, develop, manufacture and sell our pilotless eVTOL aircraft and UAV products, but also actively collaborate with our customers and partners to explore various practical use cases through operating our products globally.",
        "start_character": 19527,
        "end_character": 19783
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As an original equipment manufacturer of eVTOL aircraft and UAVs, we adopt a safe, compliant, lean and efficient production strategy across our business, focusing on effective prototyping, manufacturing, supply chain management, final assembly, integration, quality control and final acceptance testing.",
        "start_character": 57381,
        "end_character": 57684
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Besides the command-and-control system for large-scale operations and management, we have also developed an app to enable standalone operations through portable smartphones, tablets or computers to individually monitor and control our products.",
        "start_character": 38881,
        "end_character": 39125
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our commercial solutions, we provide a full spectrum of services.",
