        "end_character": 67907
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the manufacturing of eVTOL and other UAVs, we offer a comprehensive suite of services that strengthen our position as a fully integrated solution provider.",
        "start_character": 10149,
        "end_character": 10319
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, given that we are a manufacturer of civil aircraft, whose corresponding maintenance business is not segregated from the production line and who does not provide maintenance services for civil aircraft products produced by third-party manufacturers, we are therefore not considered an Independent MO, nor do we need to obtain Maintenance Certificate at the present stage.",
        "start_character": 91682,
        "end_character": 92065
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging our proprietary, safe, autonomous, and eco-friendly eVTOL technologies, we offer a range of eVTOL products and integrated services for passenger transportation, aerial tourism, aerial logistics, and emergency response.",
        "start_character": 5622,
        "end_character": 5851
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Looking ahead, we plan to further expand our service offerings to include managed commercial operations and additional services.",
        "start_character": 10630,
        "end_character": 10758
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "On April 19, 2024, we entered into an At Market Issuance Sales Agreement with China Renaissance Securities (Hong Kong) Limited as the sales agent, or the Sales Agreement, in connection with our “at-the-market offering” program, or the ATM Program.",
        "start_character": 3702,
        "end_character": 3949
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-226608",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-226608-f6e30dbcddcc9553",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-226608",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To ensure the safety, we adopt a full redundancy design and technologies in our products from day one in order to avoid single points of failure.",
